title: Alchemy
text: Light adds up. Where two beams meet on a target, it sees both colours together: red and green make yellow, red and blue make magenta, green and blue make cyan. Turn red and green into gold.
trick: two beams crossing on one target mix their colours
motif: two beams folded into a cross, mirror-symmetric about the diagonal
expect: shared>=1
---
L 2 13 0 r
L 13 2 6 g
*R 2 7 5 k
*R 7 2 5 k
% the gold, where they cross
T 7 7 0 ?
% each colour on its own, after the crossing
T 11 7 0 ?
T 7 11 0 ?
